      "writtenOn": "2023-01-31T16:40:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To be sure I understand your comment. Are you saying I shouldn\u0027t check on `mInbandRingingRuntimeDisable` or are you also saying I shouldn\u0027t update `mInbandRingingRuntimeDisable` like in the original CL\n\nBecause without updating `mInbandRingingRuntimeDisable`, it will always be false.\nIs it intended ?\n\nAnd this is used in [isInbandRingingEnabled](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/hfp/HeadsetService.java;l\u003d1927;drc\u003d56e615aed03d4c09c8e1f9269343e9365ef4ee2a)",
