      "message": "I change the logic to handle this case.\n\nIf the `mInbandRingingRuntimeDisable` is not update, I only send `+BSIR` to the new device.\nIf it\u0027s updated, then I keep advertising everyone.\n\n@joshwu@google.com Let me know what you think",
